    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME PLAY :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch, Kill, Eat \u2013 The Ultimate Fishing Challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into fast-paced, arcade-style action as you reel in bigger and better fish! From taking on time-sensitive bounties to hunting legendary fish, the stakes get higher as you prove your fishing skills. The more you fish, the bigger your catch \u2013 until you\u2019re battling massive, Kaiju-sized creatures! Do you have what it takes to become the ultimate fisherman?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729140/extras/622b3e9f3596595c49ab1eec8d542838.avif?t=1749823215\" data-has-big width=800 height=252 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An old monkey fisherman has always wanted a child. One day, after 20 years of searching, he finally catches one while fishing. But all is not well\u2014the baby monkey doesn't like the taste of fruits or nuts, a superstition of misfortune in the monkey village. Can Papa keep the evil spirits of the sea from getting out of hand while also protecting a child the villagers want to punish for an outdated belief?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729140/extras/31589b1743d266a4cd48c78c96b2a026.avif?t=1749823215\" data-has-big width=800 height=126 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> FEATURES :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast paced fishing</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Outfits Customization for your child</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Collectible Fish Models And Concept Art</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729140/extras/8616ee780a257fb2dcf9ccf81587ea91.avif?t=1749823215\" data-has-big width=800 height=135 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
